<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Secure by default – HostCut</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #14120e;
      --paper: #f4f0e8;
      --muted: #5c564e;
      --soft: #6b6760;
      --orange: #f15a22;
      --orange-soft: #fff4ef;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --card-border: #e5e0d6;
      --row-bg: #faf8f4;
      --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --font-serif: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ========== HERO / TRUST LANDING ========== */
    .hero-secure {
      position: relative;
      padding: 96px 24px 80px;
      background: var(--paper);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-secure::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -20%;
      right: -8%;
      width: 55vw;
      max-width: 560px;
      height: 55vw;
      max-height: 560px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(241,90,34,0.12) 0%, transparent 68%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    @media (min-width: 901px) {
      .hero-inner {
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
        gap: 64px;
      }
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--orange);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 56px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      max-width: 14ch;
    }

    .hero-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    .hero-lead {
      font-size: clamp(16px, 1.9vw, 18px);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .hero-points {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .hero-point {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .hero-point .check {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--orange-soft);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .hero-point .check svg {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      stroke: var(--orange);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 2.5;
    }

    /* Trust card stack */
    .trust-stack {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .trust-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .trust-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(20, 18, 14, 0.07);
    }

    .trust-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--orange-soft);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .trust-icon svg {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      stroke: var(--orange);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.8;
    }

    .trust-body strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .trust-body span {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* ========== FEATURES BENTO (provided block, adapted) ========== */
    .features-section {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 24px 96px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 780px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .section-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    .bento {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .row-1 {
      grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 1fr;
    }

    .row-2 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.45fr;
    }

    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e0d6;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
                  box-shadow 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
                  border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(20, 18, 14, 0.09);
      border-color: #d9d2c6;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .card p {
      font-size: 15.5px;
      color: #5c564e;
      line-height: 1.55;
      max-width: 440px;
    }

    .card h3::after {
      content: "";
      display: block;
      width: 32px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--orange);
      margin-top: 14px;
      border-radius: 1px;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover h3::after {
      width: 48px;
    }

    .card-1 {
      min-height: 320px;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .card-1 .meta {
      margin-top: 40px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .meta-item {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #8a857c;
    }

    .meta-item strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .card-2 {
      min-height: 320px;
      background: #fff8f5;
      border-color: #f5e6de;
    }

    .card-2:hover {
      border-color: #efd5c8;
    }

    .card-2 .tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 32px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--orange);
    }

    .card-2 .tag::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--orange);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .card-3 {
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    .card-3 .version {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 36px;
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--orange);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card-3:hover .version {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .card-4 {
      min-height: 300px;
      background: #14120e;
      border-color: #14120e;
      color: #f4f0e8;
    }

    .card-4:hover {
      border-color: #2a2622;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    }

    .card-4 h3 {
      color: #f4f0e8;
    }

    .card-4 h3::after {
      background: var(--orange);
    }

    .card-4 p {
      color: #b8b2a6;
    }

    .card-4 .locations {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .location {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      background: rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.1);
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #f4f0e8;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .card-4:hover .location {
      background: rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.16);
    }

    .bottom-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card-5,
    .card-6,
    .card-7 {
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    .card-5 .list,
    .card-6 .list,
    .card-7 .list {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 28px;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .card-5 .list li,
    .card-6 .list li,
    .card-7 .list li {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #5c564e;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .card-5:hover .list li,
    .card-6:hover .list li,
    .card-7:hover .list li {
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    .card-5 .list li::before,
    .card-6 .list li::before,
    .card-7 .list li::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: var(--orange);
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .card-6 {
      background: #fffaf7;
      border-color: #f0e6df;
    }

    .card-6:hover {
      border-color: #e8d5c8;
    }

    .card-7 {
      background: #faf8f4;
    }

    /* ========== WHAT THIS MEANS ========== */
    .means-section {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #f4f0e8;
      padding: 96px 24px 100px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .means-section::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -25%;
      left: -10%;
      width: 50vw;
      max-width: 520px;
      height: 50vw;
      max-height: 520px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(241,90,34,0.18) 0%, transparent 68%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .means-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .means-header {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .means-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--orange);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .means-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 46px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #f4f0e8;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .means-lead {
      font-size: 16.5px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #b8b2a6;
      max-width: 520px;
    }

    .means-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 701px) {
      .means-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 18px;
      }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1001px) {
      .means-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 18px;
      }
    }

    .means-card {
      background: rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      transition: background 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .means-card:hover {
      background: rgba(244, 240, 232, 0.07);
      border-color: rgba(241, 90, 34, 0.35);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .means-num {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 28px;
      color: var(--orange);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .means-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #f4f0e8;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .means-card p {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #b8b2a6;
    }

    /* Bottom assurance bar */
    .assurance-bar {
      margin-top: 48px;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      background: rgba(241, 90, 34, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(241, 90, 34, 0.25);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .assurance-text {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #f4f0e8;
      max-width: 520px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .assurance-text strong {
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .assurance-cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      background: var(--orange);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .assurance-cta:hover {
      background: #d94e1a;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* ========== RESPONSIVE ========== */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .row-1,
      .row-2 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .bottom-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-secure {
        padding: 72px 20px 56px;
      }

      .features-section {
        padding: 24px 16px 72px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 28px 22px;
        min-height: 0;
      }

      .card h3 {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .card-3 .version {
        font-size: 40px;
        padding-top: 24px;
      }

      .means-section {
        padding: 72px 20px 80px;
      }

      .assurance-bar {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 24px 22px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 36px;
        max-width: none;
      }

      .trust-card {
        padding: 18px 16px;
      }

      .trust-icon {
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ========== BLOCK 1: TRUST HERO ========== -->
  <section class="hero-secure">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Secure by default</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Protection that comes<br>
          <em>with the site</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          HTTPS, modern hosting, and reliable uptime are included from day one. Your site is protected without any extra setup or monthly security add-ons.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-points">
          <div class="hero-point">
            <span class="check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Free SSL certificate and forced HTTPS on every page</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-point">
            <span class="check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Served from Cloudflare’s global edge network</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-point">
            <span class="check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>DDoS mitigation and basic bot protection included</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-point">
            <span class="check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>No monthly security fees or complicated configuration</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-stack">
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-body">
            <strong>HTTPS everywhere</strong>
            <span>Automatic certificate + Always Use HTTPS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-body">
            <strong>Global edge network</strong>
            <span>Same infrastructure major brands rely on</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-body">
            <strong>Fast & resilient</strong>
            <span>Edge caching + automatic failover paths</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="trust-body">
            <strong>Locked down by default</strong>
            <span>No extra security product to buy or manage</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== BLOCK 2: CLOUDFLARE SECURITY FEATURES BENTO ========== -->
  <section class="features-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      Protect, accelerate, and control<br>
      every request to your <em>origin</em>
    </h2>

    <div class="bento">

      <!-- Row 1: large | small -->
      <div class="row row-1">
        <!-- 1. Smart Shield (large) -->
        <div class="card card-1">
          <div>
            <h3>Smart Shield</h3>
            <p>Protect your origin server, improve content availability, and reduce network latency by intelligently shielding traffic at the edge.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="meta">
            <div class="meta-item">
              <strong>99.99%</strong>
              origin uptime
            </div>
            <div class="meta-item">
              <strong>−40%</strong>
              origin load
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Bot Fight Mode (small) -->
        <div class="card card-2">
          <div>
            <h3>Bot Fight Mode</h3>
            <p>Automatically detect and mitigate malicious bots before they reach your application — no complex configuration required.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tag">Active protection</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Row 2: small | large -->
      <div class="row row-2">
        <!-- 3. TLS 1.3 (small) -->
        <div class="card card-3">
          <div>
            <h3>TLS 1.3</h3>
            <p>Enable the latest version of the TLS protocol for stronger encryption, faster handshakes, and improved overall performance.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="version">1.3</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Smart Tiered Cache (large) -->
        <div class="card card-4">
          <div>
            <h3>Smart Tiered Cache</h3>
            <p>Dynamically identify the optimal data centers closest to your origin to maximize cache hit ratios and reduce origin load.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="locations">
            <span class="location">SFO</span>
            <span class="location">LHR</span>
            <span class="location">FRA</span>
            <span class="location">NRT</span>
            <span class="location">SYD</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom row -->
      <div class="bottom-row">

        <!-- 5. Custom Security Rules -->
        <div class="card card-5">
          <div>
            <h3>Custom Security Rules</h3>
            <p>Create precise rules based on IP, country, URI, headers, and more to block, challenge, or allow traffic exactly how you need.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>Block known bad ASNs</li>
            <li>Challenge high-risk regions</li>
            <li>Protect sensitive paths</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Custom Rate Limit Rules -->
        <div class="card card-6">
          <div>
            <h3>Custom Rate Limit Rules</h3>
            <p>Define granular rate limits by path, method, IP, or header to stop abuse and protect critical endpoints.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>Path-based thresholds</li>
            <li>Method-specific limits</li>
            <li>IP + header combinations</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Custom Response Rules -->
        <div class="card card-7">
          <div>
            <h3>Custom Response Rules</h3>
            <p>Return custom status codes, headers, or content when a rule matches — full control over how threats are handled.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>Custom status codes</li>
            <li>Inject response headers</li>
            <li>Serve tailored content</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== BLOCK 3: WHAT THIS MEANS FOR YOU ========== -->
  <section class="means-section">
    <div class="means-inner">
      <div class="means-header">
        <p class="means-eyebrow">What this means for you</p>
        <h2 class="means-title">Security without the subscription tax</h2>
        <p class="means-lead">
          Most small-business platforms charge monthly for basic protection. With HostCut your site lives on Cloudflare’s network, so the essentials are already on.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="means-grid">
        <div class="means-card">
